#: ../../infrastructure/servers/server_devices.rst:5
#: ../../infrastructure/servers/server_migration.rst:5
#: ../../infrastructure/servers/server_placement.rst:5
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "Visão Geral"

#: ../../infrastructure/servers/server_migration.rst:7
msgid ""
"|morpheus| supports migrating virtual machines between hosts, clusters, "
"or resource pools within a cloud. The migration (also referred to as VM "
"Move) allows you to relocate a workload to a different compute target "
"without reprovisioning."
msgstr "|morpheus| oferece suporte à migração de máquinas virtuais entre hosts, clusters ou pools de recursos dentro de uma nuvem. A migração (também chamada de VM Move) permite realocar uma carga de trabalho para um destino de computação diferente sem reprovisionar."

#: ../../infrastructure/servers/server_migration.rst:9
msgid ""
"Migration is supported for cloud types that provide native VM mobility, "
"such as VMware vSphere (vMotion), Nutanix AHV, and other hypervisor "
"platforms."
msgstr "A migração é suportada para tipos de nuvem que oferecem mobilidade nativa de VM, como VMware vSphere (vMotion), Nutanix AHV e outras plataformas de hypervisor."

